 </span><span begin="00:13.650" end="00:14.220">coming </span><span begin="00:14.220" end="00:15.000">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.030" end="00:16.860"><span begin="00:15.030" end="00:15.570">Don't </span><span begin="00:15.570" end="00:16.170">hold </span><span begin="00:16.170" end="00:16.350">your </span><span begin="00:16.350" end="00:16.860">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.730" end="00:19.800"><span begin="00:17.730" end="00:17.940">What </span><span begin="00:17.940" end="00:18.060">you </span><span begin="00:18.060" end="00:18.270">did </span><span begin="00:18.270" end="00:18.450">to </span><span begin="00:18.450" end="00:19.050">me </span><span begin="00:19.050" end="00:19.800">boy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.800" end="00:21.240"><span begin="00:19.800" end="00:19.860">I </span><span begin="00:19.860" end="00:20.400">can't </span><span begin="00:20.400" end="00:21.240">forget</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.330" end="00:23.640"><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:21.600">If </span><span begin="00:21.600" end="00:21.750">you </span><span begin="00:21.750" end="00:22.140">think </span><span begin="00:22.140" end="00:22.290">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.290" end="00:22.860">coming </span><span begin="00:22.860" end="00:23.640">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.670" end="00:25.560"><span begin="00:23.670" end="00:24.210">Don't </span><span begin="00:24.210" end="00:24.810">hold </span><span begin="00:24.810" end="00:25.050">your </span><span begin="00:25.050" end="00:25.560">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.290" end="00:30.090"><span begin="00:28.290" end="00:28.590">I </span><span begin="00:28.590" end="00:28.950">was </span><span begin="00:28.950" end="00:29.310">under </span><span begin="00:29.310" end="00:29.580">your </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:29.880">spell </span><span begin="00:29.880" end="00:30.090">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.090" end="00:31.530